Licensing scope

The new validation/cooja components are covered by validation/cooja/LICENSE.
Contiki-NG and Cooja retain their upstream licence notices and are obtained
from the pinned upstream repositories rather than relicensed here.

The historical simulator previously had an empty licence file. This update
does not retroactively assign a licence to that material. The repository owner
must confirm licensing terms for the legacy code before general redistribution.
